<title>CANADA: Riverside Forest Products Ltd Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Riverside Forest Products Ltd Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>KELOWNA B.C. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr	 Profit	C$0.18   Profit	C$0.73</p>
<p> Net	 Profit	 1,404   Profit	 5,574</p>
<p> Revs		     102,800		  100,100</p>
<p>		  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr	   Loss	C$0.47   Profit	C$2.79</p>
<p> Net	   Loss	 3,600   Profit	21,200</p>
<p> Revs		     368,200		  376,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: For period ending September 30.</p>
<p>Fiscal-year 1995 earnings included C$6.2 million, or C$0.82 per share, in countervailng duty refundable.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
